// Würfelbecher des Randomizers
@501 = ~1/6: 	     You have rolled a 1 for your run. Based on a companion roll, you can roughly gauge how 
	     many companions you will encounter and adjust your playstyle accordingly. Under certain 
	     circumstances, the randomization process may take considerable time. Please wait as long 
	     as needed. No subsequent change to your result is possible! 
	     Press ENTER now to start the randomization process.~

